    where \eqn{F_{vg}^{\mathrm{feed}}} is the empirical distribution of
    variable \eqn{v} in \eqn{D_g^{\mathrm{feed}}}. Integer-like, factor, and
    ordered-factor variables are mapped back to valid observed support when
    \code{round_int = TRUE}.
